# Runs a full scrape daily at 3am - late enough that anyone actually using
# the site overnight won't compete with it for bandwidth, early enough that
# fresh prices are ready before the next day's shopping. Edit the schedule
# below and rebuild the scraper_scheduler service to change it; there's no
# env-var knob for this on purpose - anyone who wants a different schedule
# is already comfortable editing a crontab line.
#
# .env.runtime is written by scheduler_entrypoint.sh at container start -
# cron does not inherit the container's runtime environment (DB_HOST,
# BJS_STORE, etc) by default, so the job sources it explicitly.
0 3 * * * root cd /app && . /app/.env.runtime && python collector.py >> /proc/1/fd/1 2>> /proc/1/fd/2
